  "content": "<h1><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Aimz - CSGO准星模组</span></h1><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">概述</span></p><p>专为我的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a>整合包设计的自定义准星，现已作为独立模组发布。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">功能说明</span></p><p>本模组将原版十字准星替换为基于热门游戏CSGO设计的PVP战斗准星，既能提升多人对战体验，也适用于单人游戏或常规服务器。</p><p><br>需要更多准星/字体/材质包？查看我的其他作品<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/gamerpotion/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里</a></p><p>&nbsp;（不包含枪械模型）</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/977/117/2024-09-28_02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"592\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即搭建服务器与好友联机！点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>或下方横幅，使用优惠码<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享25折优惠！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>\n\n（注：根据中文阅读习惯调整了部分表述：\n1. \"standalone\"译为\"独立模组\"更符合模组圈术语\n2. \"pvp environment\"意译为\"多人对战体验\"\n3. 优惠信息中的\"25 off\"本地化为\"25折\"\n4. 保留了所有超链接和图片元素\n5. 特殊名词如CSGO、DarkRPG等保持原样）",
